WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:04.616
Subqueries become useful when one part of the
question depends on the result of another

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:10.501
query Sometimes the inner query produces one
benchmark such as average

00:00:10.527 --> 00:00:17.923
age Sometimes it produces a set of patient IDs
Sometimes

00:00:17.949 --> 00:00:23.559
we only need to know whether a matching related row
exists And sometimes

00:00:23.585 --> 00:00:29.372
the inner query depends on the current outer row
These are different contracts

00:00:29.543 --> 00:00:33.372
and recognizing the contract is more useful than
memorizing syntax
